{
  "spec": {
    "title": "CSS Box Sizing Module Level 4",
    "url": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/"
  },
  "algorithms": [
    {
      "name": "Window/requestResize()",
      "href": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#dom-window-requestresize",
      "html": "When <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled idl-code has-dfn-panel\" data-dfn-for=\"Window\" data-dfn-type=\"method\" data-export=\"\" id=\"dom-window-requestresize\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>requestResize()</code></dfn> is invoked:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>navigable</var> be the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#navigable\" id=\"ref-for-navigable\">navigable</a> that has <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" id=\"ref-for-this\">this</a> as its <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#content-window\" id=\"ref-for-content-window\">content window</a>.\nIf <var>navigable</var> is not a <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#child-navigable\" id=\"ref-for-child-navigable\">child navigable</a>,\n<a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-throw\">throw</a> a <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#notallowederror\" id=\"ref-for-notallowederror\">NotAllowedError</a></code> <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException\" id=\"ref-for-idl-DOMException\">DOMException</a></code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>host element</var> be the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#navigable-container\" id=\"ref-for-navigable-container\">navigable container</a> whose <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#content-navigable\" id=\"ref-for-content-navigable\">content navigable</a> is <var>navigable</var>.\nIf <var>host element</var> is not an HTML <code><a data-link-type=\"element\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/iframe-embed-object.html#the-iframe-element\" id=\"ref-for-the-iframe-element⑧\">iframe</a></code> element,\n<a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-throw①\">throw</a> a <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#notallowederror\" id=\"ref-for-notallowederror①\">NotAllowedError</a></code> <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException\" id=\"ref-for-idl-DOMException①\">DOMException</a></code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>document</var> be <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" id=\"ref-for-this①\">this’s</a> <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#nav-document\" id=\"ref-for-nav-document\">active document</a>.\nIf <var>document</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#document-responsive-embedded-sizing-flag\" id=\"ref-for-document-responsive-embedded-sizing-flag②\">responsive embedded sizing flag</a>\nis unset or false,\n<a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-throw②\">throw</a> a <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#notallowederror\" id=\"ref-for-notallowederror②\">NotAllowedError</a></code> <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException\" id=\"ref-for-idl-DOMException②\">DOMException</a></code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>document</var> has pending style or layout changes,\nperform them.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Set the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#internal-layout-intrinsic-size\" id=\"ref-for-internal-layout-intrinsic-size①①\">internal layout intrinsic size</a> of <var>host element</var>\nto the width and height of the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view-1/#scrolling-area\" id=\"ref-for-scrolling-area\">scrolling area</a> of <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" id=\"ref-for-this②\">this</a>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "html": "Whether two <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#funcdef-calc-size\" id=\"ref-for-funcdef-calc-size③③\">calc-size()</a> functions can be interpolated\n\tdepends on their <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#calc-size-basis\" id=\"ref-for-calc-size-basis⑤\">calc-size basis</a> values\n\t(after being <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#calc-size-prepare-for-interpolation\" id=\"ref-for-calc-size-prepare-for-interpolation\">prepared for interpolation</a>):",
      "rationale": ".switch",
      "steps": [
        {
          "operation": "switch",
          "steps": [
            {
              "case": "If either function returned failure from being prepared for interpolation",
              "html": "<p>The values cannot be interpolated.</p>"
            },
            {
              "case": "If they are identical",
              "html": "<p>The result’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#calc-size-basis\" id=\"ref-for-calc-size-basis⑥\">calc-size basis</a> is that basis value.</p>"
            },
            {
              "case": "If either is any",
              "html": "<p>The result’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#calc-size-basis\" id=\"ref-for-calc-size-basis⑦\">calc-size basis</a> is the non-<a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#valdef-calc-size-any\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-calc-size-any②\">any</a> basis.</p>"
            },
            {
              "case": "Otherwise (if they don’t match and neither side is any)",
              "html": "<p>The values cannot be interpolated.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "calc-size()/prepare for interpolation",
      "href": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#calc-size-prepare-for-interpolation",
      "html": "To <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled has-dfn-panel\" data-dfn-for=\"calc-size()\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"calc-size-prepare-for-interpolation\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\">prepare for interpolation</dfn>\n\t\ta <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#funcdef-calc-size\" id=\"ref-for-funcdef-calc-size④④\">calc-size()</a> function:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "First, simplify the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#calc-size-basis\" id=\"ref-for-calc-size-basis①①\">calc-size basis</a>, recursing as needed:",
          "rationale": ".switch",
          "steps": [
            {
              "operation": "switch",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "case": "If the calc-size basis is a calc-size() function itself",
                  "html": "<p>The <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#calc-size-basis\" id=\"ref-for-calc-size-basis①③\">calc-size basis</a> of the outer function\nis replaced with that of the inner function,\nand the inner function’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#calc-size-calculation\" id=\"ref-for-calc-size-calculation①⑤\">calc-size calculation</a>\nis <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#substitute-into-a-calc-size-calculation\" id=\"ref-for-substitute-into-a-calc-size-calculation\">substituted</a>\ninto the outer function’s <span id=\"ref-for-calc-size-calculation①⑥\">calc-size calculation</span>.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "case": "Otherwise, if the calc-size basis is a <calc-sum> whose type matches <length> (no percentage present)",
                  "html": "<p>Replace the basis with <span class=\"css\">any</span>,\nand the original basis is <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#substitute-into-a-calc-size-calculation\" id=\"ref-for-substitute-into-a-calc-size-calculation①\">substituted</a>\ninto the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#calc-size-calculation\" id=\"ref-for-calc-size-calculation①⑦\">calc-size calculation</a>.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "case": "Otherwise, if the calc-size basis is any other <calc-sum> (contains a percentage)",
                  "html": "<p>Replace the basis with <span class=\"css\">100%</span>\nand the original basis is <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#de-percentify-a-calc-size-calculation\" id=\"ref-for-de-percentify-a-calc-size-calculation\">de-percentified</a>,\nthen <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#substitute-into-a-calc-size-calculation\" id=\"ref-for-substitute-into-a-calc-size-calculation②\">substituted</a>\ninto the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#calc-size-calculation\" id=\"ref-for-calc-size-calculation①⑧\">calc-size calculation</a>.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "html": "Next, simplify the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#calc-size-calculation\" id=\"ref-for-calc-size-calculation①⑨\">calc-size calculation</a>\n\t\t\t\tas defined in <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-4/#calc-simplification\"><cite>CSS Values 4</cite> § 10.10.1 Simplification</a>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "substitute into a calc-size calculation",
      "href": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#substitute-into-a-calc-size-calculation",
      "html": "To <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled has-dfn-panel\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-export=\"\" id=\"substitute-into-a-calc-size-calculation\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\">substitute into a calc-size calculation</dfn> <var>calc</var>\n\t\ta value <var>insertion value</var>:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>calc</var> doesn’t have the <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#valdef-calc-size-size\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-calc-size-size⑧\">size</a> keyword in it,\ndo nothing.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Otherwise, replace\nevery instance of the <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#valdef-calc-size-size\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-calc-size-size⑨\">size</a> keyword in <var>calc</var>\nwith <var>insertion value</var>, wrapped in parentheses.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If this substitution would produce a value\nlarger than an UA-defined limit,\nreturn failure.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "de-percentify a calc-size calculation",
      "href": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#de-percentify-a-calc-size-calculation",
      "html": "To <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled has-dfn-panel\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-export=\"\" id=\"de-percentify-a-calc-size-calculation\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\">de-percentify a calc-size calculation</dfn> <var>calc</var>:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Replace every instance of a <a class=\"css production\" data-link-type=\"type\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-syntax-3/#typedef-percentage-token\" id=\"ref-for-typedef-percentage-token\">&lt;percentage-token&gt;</a> in <var>calc</var>\nwith <span class=\"css\">(size * N)</span>,\nwhere N is the percentage’s value divided by 100.\nReturn <var>calc</var>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}